  Occupation: Professor
  CharacterDescription: Stoic, calm and professional. Has a deep care for his students.
  CharacterArc: He begins as a dedicated educator. As the radiation spreads, he becomes nihilistic, questioning the value of human intellect and eventually viewing the "unmaking" of the world as a necessary cleansing of man-made folly.
