    dialoguesFinalDays: []
  quarantineExitLines:
  - Observed. Contained. The scientific method applied to the scientist. How fitting.
  - A cage for a man who has already let everything go. Symmetry.
  killExitLines:
  - "Reduce. Simplify. Erase. Yes\u2026 that is the correct theorem."
  - "One more variable\u2026 removed\u2026 zero is the only true answer\u2026"
