  introDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0895f7676762ba444b808767ad362585, type: 2}
  questionResponses:
  - question: Where are you coming from?
    earlyDaysAnswer: The archive, pulling first editions from the dust. Then my ethics lecture.
    midDaysAnswer: The university. The lab wing cracked. I still lectured. Eleven came.
    finalDaysAnswer: The empty faculty. I left my lecture notes. No reason to carry them.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: The chemistry laboratory. Fifteen years teaching organic chemistry there.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: My flat. I cancelled all lectures weeks ago. Routine is for the unreflective.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: Faculty housing. I live alone. Never married. My soundest decision.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
    cameraTrigger: 
  - question: Are you experiencing any symptoms?
    earlyDaysAnswer: Headaches, occasionally. I have always had them. Nothing for the polyclinic.
    midDaysAnswer: I lose track of time. I look up and it is dark.
    finalDaysAnswer: A taste of copper in the mouth. Two weeks now. I no longer mind.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: None. A disciplined mind has never once permitted a headache.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: Nothing. At twenty-eight one recovers quickly. I sleep well, wake rested.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: Nothing. I resigned last year for my health. It has improved since.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
    cameraTrigger: 
  idleBarks:
    earlyDays:
    - My students ask what comes next. I tell them history. They dislike it.
    - Order is its own kind of courage, officer. You are practicing it now.
    midDays:
    - Human intellect is a very fragile glass, and the hammer is coming.
    - I lectured an empty hall yesterday. Habit is the skeleton of civilization.
    finalDays:
    - Why check papers? Soon the ash will be the only record anyone keeps.
    - Zero is the only honest number in a collapsing system. Everything reduces.
    uncannyEarlyDays: []
    uncannyMidDays: []
    uncannyFinalDays: []
